# Copy to `.dev.vars` (git-ignored) for LOCAL development only. Never commit real values.

# --- Local admin (bun run admin:dev -> http://127.0.0.1:8787/admin) ---------------------------------------------
# Signs this owner in WITHOUT Cloudflare Access, but only for requests to localhost/127.0.0.1 that did not pass
# through Cloudflare. Must also be listed in OWNER_EMAILS. NEVER set ADMIN_LOCAL_DEV_EMAIL as a Worker variable or
# secret on any Cloudflare environment (preview or production).
OWNER_EMAILS=your-own-email@example.com
ADMIN_LOCAL_DEV_EMAIL=your-own-email@example.com

# --- Real Cloudflare Access verification (what preview/production use) ----------------------------------------
# Only needed locally if you want to test with a real Access token instead of the local sign-in above.
# ACCESS_TEAM_DOMAIN=your-team-name.cloudflareaccess.com
# ACCESS_AUD=paste-the-64-character-application-audience-tag-here

# --- AI News (optional, local only) ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Without a key, "Run now" in the admin collects and dedupes news but does not summarise it. Use a Google AI Studio key
# from a project WITHOUT billing, so every call stays on the free tier (no charges possible). On Cloudflare this is a
# Worker SECRET, never a plain variable.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# NEWS_MODEL=gemini-3.5-flash-lite
# NEWS_MAX_SOURCES_PER_RUN=4
# NEWS_MAX_SUMMARIES_PER_RUN=4
